{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很享受和对方亲近，越来越喜欢对方，但开始想确认这份关系能不能一直持续。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"依恋、期待、甜蜜、不安、隐隐的疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"怕自己的需要给对方添负担、又怕对方不再需要自己；想收起喜欢却发现反而更难受；幸福中逐渐混入悲伤。这些具体的心理转折需要读中后段才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经很在意对方，想相信两个人可以一直这样亲近，却开始害怕这份幸福会发生变化。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、珍惜、患得患失、甜中带苦\",\n      \"missed\": \"从最初害怕给对方造成负担，到现在害怕自己不再被需要的变化；以及不再隐藏喜欢是因为真心而不是单纯冲动。这些信息藏在连续长段落里，扫读时不容易抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正处在一段让自己很幸福的亲密关系里，但越喜欢对方，越开始担心未来失去这份亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、依恋、忐忑、失落、隐痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"他已经不想再装作不在乎，往回藏心意反而更难受；刚刚坚定地说了是，心里却立刻追问可是呢；下方音乐与脚步、叹息和胸口下沉的对应关系，也需要读完整段才知道。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主段虽然字号大、对比强，但整块文字几乎没有内部重点区分，一眼容易只抓到开头的想要长久和右侧高亮的幸福里也生出疼，中间最关键的心理原因——从怕给对方添负担转为怕对方不再需要自己——藏在长段落和侧边较小的条目里。右侧八条同时出现，也增加了选择先看哪条的负担。三块内容整体属于同一段关系中的情绪变化，能够串起来，但第一眼更容易知道他甜蜜又不安，不容易马上知道这种疼具体从何而来。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c6d4df68-cdcf-475b-8bc0-98d2bb54f7c9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010402891227Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.61, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:05:23.498893+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7293e2874e41e39c1c2d3d18406c826671ec0d5e980708eb112af10f1630489a", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010402891227Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "37b7ffd8b536d7f41956601b58026f64415de92650cce1066d310a92e966912b"}}}
